# Implementation Plan: Production-Ready Monetization (Stripe & Fulfillment)

While we have the "business logic" for Bundles and Memberships, the commerce engine is currently mocked and incomplete. This plan will transition SkillPilot to a real-world commerce experience for students.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Database Refactor**: We will transition `OrderItem` to a **Polymorphic Relationship**. This allows students to buy Courses, Bundles, and Membership Tiers in a single checkout experience.

## Proposed Changes

### [Component Name] Backend: Polymorphic Commerce

#### [MODIFY] [Order Item Migration](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Orders/database/migrations/2026_03_16_123157_create_order_items_table.php)
- Replace `course_id` with `itemable_id` and `itemable_type`.

#### [MODIFY] [OrderController.php](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Orders/app/Http/Controllers/OrderController.php)
- Update the `store` method to accept a generic `items` array with `id` and `type` (Course, Bundle, or MembershipPlan).

### [Component Name] Backend: Stripe & Fulfillment Engine

#### [NEW] [FulfillmentService.php](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Orders/app/Services/FulfillmentService.php)
- Centralized logic to grant access upon successful payment:
    - **Bundle**: Creates `BundlePurchase` (unlock rights).
    - **Membership**: Creates/Updates `Subscription` and sets user tier.
    - **Course**: Direct enrollment or "Unlock Rights".

#### [MODIFY] [PaymentController.php](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Payments/app/Http/Controllers/PaymentController.php)
- Integrate Stripe PHP SDK (`stripe/stripe-php`).
- Create `createCheckoutSession` for redirection.
- Create `webhook` to listen for Stripe's `checkout.session.completed` and trigger `FulfillmentService`.

---

### [Component Name] Frontend: Unified Checkout UX

#### [NEW] [checkout/page.tsx](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-frontend/src/app/%28dashboard%29/checkout/page.tsx)
- A high-end, premium checkout summary page for students.
- Direct integration with Stripe Secure Checkout.

---

## Open Questions
- Do you have a **Stripe Dashboard account** ready for us to use API keys (`pk_test`, `sk_test`)? 
- Should we support **Coupons/Discount Codes** in this phase, or keep it to a baseline Stripe integration first?

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Create `FulfillmentTest.php` to verify that status transitions in Orders correctly trigger the corresponding access grants.
- Mock Stripe Webhook payloads to ensure the integration is resilient.

### Manual Verification
- Simulate a full purchase flow:
    - Add a Membership Tier (Premium) to the cart.
    - Complete payment via Stripe Test Card.
    - Verify the Student Dashboard confirms "Premium Status" and unlocks the correct courses.
